  {%- comment -%} ══════════ FAQ ══════════ {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="inf-section inf-section-alt" id="inf-faq">
    <div class="inf-container-narrow">
      <div class="inf-section-header center">
        <span class="inf-section-label">Frequently Asked</span>
        <h2>Infinity Massage Chair <span class="inf-underline">FAQ</span></h2>
      </div>
      <div style="border-top:1px solid var(--inf-border)">
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Are Infinity massage chairs worth it?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Yes — particularly when matched to the right buyer. Infinity consistently delivers strong feature technology (especially the Syner-D tandem system) at competitive prices. The key is matching the model to your body type and use case, which is why in-person guidance matters.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>What is the best Infinity massage chair?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>The best Infinity massage chair depends on what you're optimizing for. The Gen Max 4D is a strong starting point for many buyers comparing premium 4D Infinity models. <strong>Best Syner-D entry:</strong> Luminary Syner-D. <strong>Best for stretch-focused comfort:</strong> Smart Chair X3 4D. <strong>Best flagship:</strong> Circadian DualFlex 4D. <strong>Best for tall users:</strong> Ultra Imperial Syner-D or Circadian. We recommend trying select models at our showroom before deciding.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>What does Syner-D mean in Infinity chairs?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Syner-D® is Infinity's proprietary tandem roller technology. Two independent massage mechanisms run simultaneously — one above the other — in coordinated rhythm. The result is a "two-handed" massage feel across the full back. It's genuinely different from a standard single-mechanism chair and is best understood by experiencing it in person.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>How much do Infinity massage chairs cost?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Infinity chairs range from $6,799 (Riage 4D) to $16,999 (Circadian DualFlex and Ultra Imperial Syner-D). Most buyers find the best feature-for-dollar value in the $8,000–$13,000 range. Financing is available starting at 0% APR through Affirm.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Can I try Infinity massage chairs in person near San Jose?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs carries multiple Infinity models at our San Jose showroom at Westfield Oakridge Mall and at our Pleasanton location at Stoneridge Shopping Center. We strongly recommend an in-person visit — the Syner-D feel in particular is impossible to understand from a spec sheet alone. <a href="{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-store">Book your visit here.</a></p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Is Infinity or Osaki better?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Neither brand is objectively "better" — they serve different buyer profiles. Osaki delivers more assertive massage intensity and dual-engine Duo designs. Infinity delivers the proprietary Syner-D tandem feel and stronger stretch-focused comfort. HOMC carries both — we'll walk you through a direct comparison in person.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Do Infinity chairs come with a warranty?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Yes. Infinity massage chairs include manufacturer-backed warranties covering parts, labor, and structural frame. Coverage terms vary by model tier. HOMC assists with all warranty coordination on your behalf.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>What is the difference between the Circadian and Ultra Imperial?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Both cost $16,999 and share the 49" Flex-Track. The key difference: the Circadian DualFlex uses <strong>two independent 4D mechanisms</strong> running simultaneously (DualFlex) — making it more intense and comprehensive. The Ultra Imperial uses a single premium Syner-D mechanism with more emphasis on stretch depth and an enveloping feel. The Circadian is "more intensive," the Ultra Imperial is "more enveloping." Try both in person to feel the difference.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Which Infinity 4D massage chair should I compare first?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>If you are comparing an Infinity 4D massage chair, start with Riage 4D, Gen Max 4D, Smart Chair X3, and Circadian DualFlex 4D. Riage 4D is a strong entry point, Gen Max 4D offers a broader premium feature set, Smart Chair X3 is useful for X3-specific shoppers, and Circadian DualFlex is positioned for buyers comparing Infinity's advanced flagship tier.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Do Infinity massage chairs offer shiatsu-style massage?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Yes. Many Infinity massage chairs include massage techniques inspired by shiatsu-style kneading, rolling, tapping, and pressure-based massage patterns. If you are searching for an Infinity shiatsu massager, compare full-size Infinity massage chairs carefully because they are very different from portable massagers in coverage, size, controls, and price.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>What should I know about Infinity massage chair warranty and service?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Infinity massage chair warranty coverage can vary by model and warranty term. Some warranties may include parts, labor, or structural framework coverage, while service may require pre-approval. Coverage can also have exclusions for misuse, neglect, transportation damage, theft, power surges, or other conditions. Always confirm current warranty details before purchase.</p></div></div>
        <div class="inf-faq-item"><div class="inf-faq-q" onclick="infFaq(this)"><h3>Can House of Massage Chairs help with Infinity service questions?</h3><svg class="inf-faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 13h-6v6h-2v-6H5v-2h6V5h2v6h6v2z"/></svg></div><div class="inf-faq-a"><p>Yes. House of Massage Chairs helps buyers understand Infinity massage chair service, warranty coordination, parts coverage, massage chair delivery and setup, and ownership expectations before and after purchase. Contact our team to discuss Infinity massage chair warranty and service support or financing options.</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

